  "description": "“W-Wait! Hyunseok, if we keep doing this, we’ll really get caught!”\n\nDo Hyunseok, Mi-joo’s longtime unrequited love, and her friend from next door.\n\nShe’s kept her feelings hidden, afraid they might not even remain friends.\n\n“Do Hyunseok, down there….”\n\nBy chance, she ends up trapped in a closet with her childhood friend.\n\n“This happened because of you. So take responsibility, Choi Mi-joo.”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12783095)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/in-the-closet-with-my-childhood-friend/list?title_no=8650)",
